       <p class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"309\">Nexora indexes 190+ countries in real-time. Whether it's a deep-tech lab in Zurich or a sustainability grant in Nairobi, our engine finds it before the crowd does.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"space-y-6\" data-kid=\"310\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\" data-kid=\"311\">\n              <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#FF4F00]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-1\" data-kid=\"312\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-check text-[#FF4F00] text-sm\" data-kid=\"313\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"314\">Real-time global indexing</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\" data-kid=\"315\">\n              <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#FF4F00]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-1\" data-kid=\"316\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-check text-[#FF4F00] text-sm\" data-kid=\"317\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"318\">Multi-language translation engine</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\" data-kid=\"319\">\n              <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#FF4F00]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-1\" data-kid=\"320\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-check text-[#FF4F00] text-sm\" data-kid=\"321\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"322\">Direct verified provider links</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"md:w-1/2 relative\" data-kid=\"323\">\n          <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/World_map_-_low_resolution.svg\" class=\"w-full h-auto opacity-20 grayscale\" alt=\"World Map\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"324\">\n          \n          \n          <div class=\"absolute top-[35%] left-[20%] group\" data-kid=\"325\">\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full animate-ping absolute\" data-kid=\"326\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full relative\" data-kid=\"327\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] left-[45%] group\" data-kid=\"328\">\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full animate-ping absolute\" style=\"animation-delay: 1s\" data-kid=\"329\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full relative\" data-kid=\"330\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-[45%] left-[65%] group\" data-kid=\"331\">\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full animate-ping absolute\" style=\"animation-delay: 2s\" data-kid=\"332\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full relative\" data-kid=\"333\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-[60%] left-[80%] group\" data-kid=\"334\">\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full animate-ping absolute\" style=\"animation-delay: 1.5s\" data-kid=\"335\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-[#FF4F00] rounded-full relative\" data-kid=\"336\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"py-32 px-8 bg-white border-t border-slate-100\" data-kid=\"337\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"338\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-[48px] p-12 lg:p-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center\" data-kid=\"339\">\n        <div class=\"md:w-1/2\" data-kid=\"340\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-[#111111] mb-6 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"341\">For Universities, Accelerators & Organizations</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-light\" data-kid=\"342\">List your programs on the world's most intelligent discovery network and reach qualified, ambitious talent exactly when they're looking.</p>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-6 mb-10\" data-kid=\"343\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"344\">\n              <p class=\"font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm\" data-kid=\"345\">Publish opportunities</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"346\">Instant global reach.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"347\">\n              <p class=\"font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm\" data-kid=\"348\">Reach global talent</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"349\">100k+ active seekers.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"350\">\n              <p class=\"font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm\" data-kid=\"351\">AI-powered matching</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"352\">High intent applications.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"353\">\n              <p class=\"font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm\" data-kid=\"354\">Analytics dashboard</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"355\">Track your visibility.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"bg-[#111111] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-sm hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all\" data-kid=\"356\">\n            Post an Opportunity\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"md:w-1/2\" data-kid=\"357\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl hairline-border shadow-2xl shadow-slate-200/50\" data-kid=\"358\">\n             <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\" data-kid=\"359\">\n               <h6 class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"360\">Partner Dashboard</h6>\n               <div class=\"flex gap-1\" data-kid=\"361\">\n                 <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" data-kid=\"362\">